{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense, procedurally generated dungeon crawler where the only source of light is you. Trade concealment for visibility, exchange light for strength, or lose speed for endurance. Regardless of what you choose, survival isn't guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/8a83545f81e8484e7f8788b533a48096.avif?t=1768255379\" width=800 height=275 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master specialized &quot;Light Aura&quot; items</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each revealing the room in different ways: soft light, LiDAR, scanlines, echolocation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attack counts. With every magical power you use, you pay with light</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a wide arsenal of hand-crafted &amp; unique weapons</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee, ranged, and magic, each with their own strengths &amp; playstyles</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle between hundreds of items, ranging from swords to trinkets for passive stat boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer three distinct, playable regions</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with exclusive items, enemies, and styles</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a large variety of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore numerous randomized rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak to a multitude of NPCs</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear, learn secrets, and even gamble in-game currency</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance on the edge of life and death with the Permadeath option</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/caa6fa093b06fc0ba9dc8e82af86c944.poster.avif?t=1768255379\" width=1056 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/caa6fa093b06fc0ba9dc8e82af86c944.webm?t=1768255379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/caa6fa093b06fc0ba9dc8e82af86c944.mp4?t=1768255379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHT AURA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They said gods didn't exist. They were wrong, and the most vicious took the very resource needed to survive: light. Now, you're left to channel whatever magic you have into a fragile glow to guide your path. The more you shine, the more you can see, but the easier they can find you. Look for a good balance and use the darkness to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/38c8c9c6c01e0b4eef70905b7df4a062.poster.avif?t=1768255379\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/38c8c9c6c01e0b4eef70905b7df4a062.webm?t=1768255379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/38c8c9c6c01e0b4eef70905b7df4a062.mp4?t=1768255379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chests and crates litter the place, each containing money or a weapon. Everything you find has its own use, strengthening you in various ways. Some will let you conjure magic, others will cut deep into the flesh of your foes, and a few might even keep you breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/c11fbe285848a2e0f15ef8638681ccf6.avif?t=1768255379\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras_big/c11fbe285848a2e0f15ef8638681ccf6.webp?t=1768255379 width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LABYRINTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gray, abandoned maze of brick walls and tiles. With no landmarks, it can be easy to lose your way. Cursed souls drift eternally while rogue machines lurk around every corner, forcing a dangerous environment. Weapons here are plentiful, but the lack of magic is suffocating. The darkness ascends from below. Something has to be down here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/1a919786bf4f38538af7df4df451e815.avif?t=1768255379\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras_big/1a919786bf4f38538af7df4df451e815.webp?t=1768255379 width=1560 height=601 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BURIED DESERT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buried in old, forgotten temples lie weapons charged with a magical force, though traversing the region may prove difficult. Otherworldly beings are constantly on the hunt as sections get locked down, and one turn could lead to certain death. There's no telling how deep these ruins go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/4da7920030ea48341c25d80725f8ab4d.avif?t=1768255379\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GREEN VALLEYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once full of life, the valleys now conceal hidden traps and small creatures under the thick foliage. Deadly predators stalk through the tall grass, using the rugged terrain to their advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/90ae289277f34e77774601db32d47d16.avif?t=1768255379\" width=800 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE VILLAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endangered sanctuary at the heart of chaos; the residents just don't know it yet. Here, upgrade your weapons, refill your supplies, and recuperate before facing the horrors ahead. The four paths surrounding the village all lead into the unknown that grows restless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/ebd9348f4dcefcb1f3487314b4fa1597.avif?t=1768255379\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866620?t=1768255379","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866620?t=1768255379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/500d486f32ee8ff5deea80d8f7e9bde56dbe55ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768255379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/500d486f32ee8ff5deea80d8f7e9bde56dbe55ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768255379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense, procedurally generated dungeon crawler where the only source of light is you. Trade concealment for visibility, exchange light for strength, or lose speed for endurance. Regardless of what you choose, sur